  "sentences": [
    {
      "en": "These days, a lot of people work from home at least a few days a week.",
      "ja": "最近では、多くの人が少なくとも週に数日は在宅で働いています。",
      "chunkIds": [
        "c1",
        "c2",
        "c3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "It saves time because you don't have to commute.",
      "ja": "通勤しなくてよいので時間の節約になります。",
      "chunkIds": [
        "c4",
        "c5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "You can also focus better without the noise of a busy office.",
      "ja": "また、忙しいオフィスの騒音がないので集中しやすくなります。",
      "chunkIds": [
        "c6",
        "c7",
        "c8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "On the other hand, some people feel lonely and find it hard to stop working.",
      "ja": "一方で、孤独を感じたり、仕事をやめにくいと感じたりする人もいます。",
      "chunkIds": [
        "c9",
        "c10",
        "c11",
        "c12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "That's why it's important to set clear rules, like when to start and finish.",
      "ja": "だからこそ、いつ始めていつ終えるかなど、はっきりしたルールを決めることが大切です。",
      "chunkIds": [
        "c13",
        "c14",
        "c15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "With the right balance, working from home can be both productive and comfortable.",
      "ja": "適切なバランスがあれば、在宅勤務は生産的で快適なものになります。",
      "chunkIds": [
